{"id": "Image Segmentation", "desc": "Image Segmentation divides an image into segments where each pixel in the image is mapped to an object. This task has multiple variants such as instance segmentation, panoptic segmentation and semantic segmentation.", "input-type": ["image"], "output-type": ["image"]}
{"id": "Depth Estimation", "desc": "Depth estimation is the task of predicting depth of the objects present in an image.", "input-type": ["image"], "output-type": ["image"]}
